{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17846","headline":"节度宣武酬乐天梦得 · 令狐楚","name":"节度宣武酬乐天梦得","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蓬莱仙监客曹郎，曾枉高车客大梁。\n见拥旌旄治军旅，知亲笔砚事文章。\n愁看柳色悬离恨，忆递花枝助酒狂。\n洛下相逢肯相寄，南金璀错玉凄凉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"令狐楚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17846.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17846","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}